# API contracts (gateway ↔ cloud)

Before changing Soft-AP JSON or uplink payloads:

1. Inspect sender · 2. Receiver (web ingest) · 3. Consumers · 4. Deployed compatibility · 5. Define contract · 6. Validate · 7. Tests/captures · 8. Document breaks

## Rules

- No silent field rename/remove. Do not invent telemetry fields or Modbus registers.
- Validate inputs; handle missing/malformed/stale/unexpected fields.
- Prefer backward compatibility; preserve raw diagnostic evidence.
- Cross-repo web changes must be identified. Coordinate shared ingest secret → per-device credential migration; do not claim the shared-secret exception resolved without verified migration.
